<style>
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } .hero-img { max-height: 320px; } }
</style>
<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Solar installation in Abuja means planning for strong sun, a dusty dry season and, often, a large detached house with a heavy load. If you are in Gwarinpa, Maitama, Wuse, Garki, Lugbe, Kubwa or Lokogoma and your light keeps going, you are probably spending on petrol to fill the gaps. This page covers what to ask for and what to check before you pay anyone.</p><p>Harmattan Solar Co advertises independent Nigerian solar installers. This site installs and sells nothing, and the installer who quotes your job is the one responsible for the work. Call now on +234 809 000 0000, then ask for <strong>two or three comparable written quotes</strong> that name the exact inverter, battery and panel models.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Abuja</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Abuja Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Home solar installation in Abuja</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Hybrid systems for Abuja flats and larger detached houses. An independent installer should size it from a load audit of your own appliances.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Inverter and battery installation</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">For old tubular batteries that no longer last the night, or a move to lithium. Ask the installer to write the exact battery model and its manufacturer cycle claim on the quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Commercial solar for Abuja businesses</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Shops, schools, clinics, churches and small offices that want to cut diesel. A good quote states which loads the system carries and what still runs on the gen.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Solar and inverter repair</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A system that keeps tripping, or batteries that die before morning, can point to poor sizing or wiring. An independent installer can inspect it and quote the fix.</p>
      </div>
</div>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .feat-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } }
